      "content": "i dont think i want to \"reach out\" or find \"support.\" that just feels like more work. more talking, more explaining myself to people who won't get it anyway. it's just more noise. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the noise and the exhaustion is just to... not be here anymore. like, if the game is rigged and i never had a chance, why keep playing? it feels like the only way to finally get some real peace is to just let go of everything.\n Balance the idea that. If goal is to see if it nud",
